TranslationUnitDecl
`-ClassTemplateDecl Outer
  |-TemplateTypeParmDecl referenced class depth 0 index 0 T
  `-CXXRecordDecl struct Outer definition
    |-FunctionTemplateDecl conv
    | |-TemplateTypeParmDecl referenced class depth 1 index 0 U
    | `-CXXMethodDecl conv 'U (T)'
    |   `-ParmVarDecl t 'T'
    `-ClassTemplateDecl In
      |-TemplateTypeParmDecl referenced class depth 1 index 0 U
      `-CXXRecordDecl struct In definition
        |-FieldDecl a 'T'
        `-FieldDecl b 'U'
